    "ciphertext": "~022078608243049415120",
    "description": "Developed a complete AI-powered healthcare mobile application for both iOS and Android using React Native Expo with a Python Django backend.\n\nThe project included end-to-end UI/UX design, mobile app development, backend APIs, database architecture, subscription management, AI-powered chat functionality, and complete App Store deployment.\n\nKey Features\n\n• Modern UI/UX design\n• User registration & authentication\n• Period and health tracking\n• AI Chat Assistant\n• Premium subscription plans\n• Secure payment integration\n• Push notifications\n• Personal health dashboard\n• Articles & educational content management\n• User profile management\n• Payment history & invoice download\n• Admin dashboard\n• User management\n• Subscription management\n• Content & article management\n• Settings management\n• TestFlight deployment\n• Google Play deployment\n• Apple App Store deployment\n• Complete source code handover with GitHub\n\nTechnology Stack\n\nFrontend: React Native Expo\n\nBackend: Python Django\n\nDatabase: PostgreSQL / MySQL\n\nAPI: REST / JSON APIs\n\nThe application was built with scalability, security, and long-term maintainability in mind, providing a premium user experience across both Android and iOS devices while enabling seamless administration through a dedicated backend panel.",
